>> Animal := Bagay bago.
Animal kapag: ['sound:'] gawin: { :s sarili-ko sound := s. }.
Animal kapag: ['makeSound'] gawin: { Labas isulat: sarili-ko sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal bago.
Cat kapag: ['init'] gawin: { sarili-ko sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat kapag: ['meow'] gawin: { sarili makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
